From: briansp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:11:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] scripts: rdna4-bitcheck test tools (mmbit, hcbit) -
 optional, not for the build

Standalone byte-identity checkers used to validate the preceding kernel patch:
mmbit hashes 60 MUL_MAT / MUL_MAT_ID outputs at Flash-Next shapes, hcbit hashes
GGML_OP_HC_MIX at nt 1..8. Development aids only; this commit can be dropped
without affecting the kernel changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
